@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">
            <div class="matrimony-card p-5 rounded-4 mb-4">
                <h1 class="brand-font display-6 fw-bold text-dark mb-4">About Matrimony Hub</h1>
                <p class="lead text-muted">
                    Matrimony Hub was created with a clear purpose: to provide Bangladeshis with a safe, authentic, and dignified platform to discover compatible life partners.
                </p>
                <hr class="my-4 border-light">
                
                <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4 mb-3">Our Core Philosophy</h4>
                <p class="text-muted">
                    In a world saturated with casual dating apps, marriage in our culture is a sacred union between two individuals and their families. We believe prospective brides and grooms deserve a space where profiles are authentic, identities are proven, and mutual respect is upheld from the first glance.
                </p>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4 mb-3">The NID Verification Standard</h4>
                <p class="text-muted">
                    Identity fraud and inaccurate information are major concerns in matrimonial search. Matrimony Hub addresses this through a dedicated National ID (NID) verification workflow. When an identity is reviewed and approved by our moderation team, the profile receives an official verified badge.
                </p>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4 mb-3">Respectful Contact Gate</h4>
                <p class="text-muted">
                    To prevent harassment and unsolicited spam, private contact details (phone numbers and emails) are securely locked. A user must confirm their genuine intent through a nominal unlock fee verified directly by reliable Bangladeshi payment gateways such as bKash, SSLCommerz, and Nagad.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
